### ============================================
### FR-14 Category CRUD — Bug Reproduction
### Extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Yêu cầu: Backend đang chạy trên localhost:3000
### Cách dùng: Click "Send Request" phía trên mỗi request
### ============================================

### --- STEP 0: Login lấy token ---

# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@eshop.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ============================================
### BUG-C-001 (HIGH) — Tạo category tên rỗng
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### SPEC: "Tên danh mục là bắt buộc, không được để trống"
### ============================================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": ""
}

###

### ============================================
### BUG-C-002 (HIGH) — Tạo category không gửi field name
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

###

### ============================================
### BUG-C-003 (MEDIUM) — Tạo category tên whitespace-only
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### ============================================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "   "
}

###

### ============================================
### BUG-C-004 (CRITICAL) — XSS injection qua tên danh mục
### Expected: 400 hoặc sanitize
### ============================================

POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "<script>alert(1)</script>"
}

###

